{"id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-term.md","title":"Term","display":"df-term — Term","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-term","aliases":["92-df-term"],"display":"df-term — Term","depends_on":["[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-expression]]"],"source":"第 II 章 pp. 14–15（PDF 31–32）","source_status":"本地 PA 项文法"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-term"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-term</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-term — Term"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 14–15（PDF 31–32）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 PA 项文法"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-term-—-Term-$t$\">df-term — Term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G\">\\(\\Sigma_G\\)</span> (signature of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Expr}\">\\(\\mathrm{Expr}\\)</span> (expression constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{Term}_G \\coloneqq \\bigcap\\Bigl\\{T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\ \\Bigm|\\ 0\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Var}_G\\subseteq T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(S(t)\\in T\\bigr)\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl((s+t)\\in T\\land(s\\cdot t)\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{Term}_G \\coloneqq \\bigcap\\Bigl\\{T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\ \\Bigm|\\ 0\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Var}_G\\subseteq T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(S(t)\\in T\\bigr)\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl((s+t)\\in T\\land(s\\cdot t)\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> : 项集</li>\n<li>项由常量、变量、后继、加法、乘法递归构造</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t)\">\\(S(t)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s+t)\">\\((s+t)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s\\cdot t)\">\\((s\\cdot t)\\)</span> 表示由相应 token 和括号连接成的全括号语法串，不是尚未解释的数值运算</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>是常量项</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(t)\">\\(S(t)\\)</span>是项<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>的后继项</li>\n<li>numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar{n} = S^n(0)\">\\(\\bar{n} = S^n(0)\\)</span>是特殊的项</li>\n<li>项表示算术表达式</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本文 0、S、+、乘法为独立 token。原书后继是尾 accent，函数名是 f 加下标划线串，且 L_E 含指数；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"742319eca99c7bd5\" href=\"?note=742319eca99c7bd5\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-terms\">92-df-smullyan-terms</a>。这里保留 G 的独立文法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-term-—-Term-$t$","text":"df-term — Term $t$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-expression]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_G$ (signature of $G$, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-expression","status":"resolved","id":"c56ec2b54fc34fc6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Expr}$ (expression constructor, see [[92-df-expression]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable-symbol set, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-terms","status":"resolved","id":"742319eca99c7bd5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本文 0、S、+、乘法为独立 token。原书后继是尾 accent，函数名是 f 加下标划线串，且 L_E 含指数；见 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]。这里保留 G 的独立文法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Expr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}term} \\vdash \\mathrm{Term}_G \\coloneqq \\bigcap\\Bigl\\{T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)\\ \\Bigm|\\ 0\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Var}_G\\subseteq T\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\bigl(S(t)\\in T\\bigr)\\land\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\\bigl((s+t)\\in T\\land(s\\cdot t)\\in T\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"S(t)","display":false},{"tex":"(s+t)","display":false},{"tex":"(s\\cdot t)","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar{n} = S^n(0)","display":false}],"bytes":1392,"backlinks":[{"id":"89c266445c099752","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dc02207ec79f9d66","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t_1, t_2 \\in \\mathrm{Term}_G$ (terms, see [[92-df-term]])"},{"id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2dc58bf648f8b3b2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term, see [[92-df-term]])"},{"id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term set, see [[92-df-term]])"},{"id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term set, see [[92-df-term]])"},{"id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s,t,s_1,t_1,s_2,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (terms, see [[92-df-term]])"},{"id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b78092e29a02d697","anch